Third-party material used by this repository.

The Swift package dependencies are not vendored; they are fetched by SwiftPM at the exact versions pinned in
Package.swift and Package.resolved, and ship under their own licenses (Apache License 2.0 with Runtime Library
Exception):

- swift-async-algorithms: linked into the app (the debounce of settings writes), with its dependency swift-collections
- swift-collections: linked into the app through swift-async-algorithms, and into the test support (HeapModule)
- swift-subprocess and swift-argument-parser: developer tooling only (vmr), never linked into the app
- swift-system: a dependency of swift-subprocess, so developer tooling only
